flowchart TB
    Resident[Resident confirms photo and location] --> Web[React Vite application]
    Neighbor[Second resident observation] --> Web
    Web -->|authenticated commands / operation polling| API[FastAPI domain commands]
    API --> Observation[Original observations preserved]
    Observation --> Canonical[One canonical incident]
    Canonical --> Draft[Immutable report revision]
    Draft --> Approval[Resident approval bound to payload and attachment hashes]
    Approval --> Reserve[Atomic submission reservation]
    Reserve --> Browser[Deterministic allowlisted browser executor]
    Browser --> Portal[Fictional agency portal]
    Portal --> Ticket[Private receipt and raw agency status]
    Ticket --> Check[Bounded status reads]
    Check --> Verify[Optional resident verification]
    Verify --> Followers[Shared case outcome and notifications]
    Check -->|agency closure| Unverified[Physical resolution remains separate]
    Browser -->|possible write without receipt| Unknown[OUTCOME_UNKNOWN]
    Unknown -->|receipt lookup only| Ticket
    API --> Analyst[Issue Analyst: evidence and nearby tools]
    API --> Router[Routing Specialist: registry and ownership tools]
    API --> Coordinator[Case Coordinator: prepare and bounded next actions]
    subgraph Local[Local fixture mode]
      SQLite[(SQLite records + jobs)]
      Files[Private local evidence]
      Worker[Restartable leased worker + virtual clock]
      Fixtures[Deterministic model fixtures]
      Playwright[Local Chromium]
    end
    subgraph AWS[AWS demo configuration - deployment separately verified]
      Cognito[Cognito JWT authorization]
      Lambda[API Gateway + Lambda]
      Runtime[AgentCore Runtime + Strands + Bedrock]
      Durable[Step Functions Standard + server-side callbacks]
      Dynamo[(DynamoDB conditional transactions)]
      S3[Private encrypted S3]
      CloudBrowser[AgentCore Browser]
      Hosting[Amplify Hosting]
      Map[Amazon Location]
      Logs[Sanitized CloudWatch / OpenTelemetry]
    end
    API --> SQLite
    API --> Lambda
    Worker --> SQLite
    API --> Files
    Analyst --> Fixtures
    Browser --> Playwright
    Lambda --> Cognito
    Lambda --> Dynamo
    Lambda --> S3
    Lambda --> Durable
    Durable --> Runtime
    Runtime --> Analyst
    Runtime --> Router
    Runtime --> Coordinator
    Browser --> CloudBrowser
    Hosting --> Web
    Web --> Map
    Runtime --> Logs
